                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The Quiet Reply",
                                  "A maintenance note\ndescribes a bell\nloud enough to\nwake the market",
                                  "and a reply wire\ntoo frail to\nsurvive the cold.\nThe note is not",
                                  "about sound. Its\nauthor wanted the\nsender to know\nsomeone had",
                                  "listened. Dot has\nunderlined that\nsentence."
                                ],
                                "avatarId": "",
                                "minHeight": 4,
                                "maxHeight": 7,
